From: Cheng-Han Wu <hank20010209@gmail.com>
Subject: Docs/admin-guide/mm/damon: fix 'parametrs' typo
Date: Sun, 26 Apr 2026 16:16:15 -0700

Fix the misspelling of "parametrs" as "parameters" in reclaim.rst and
lru_sort.rst.

